\caption{Residual RMS of the simulated antenna temperature (black) and of
global 21-cm signal models filtered with the same modes (5--95 per cent of
ensemble in grey band, median dashed) as a function of number of eigenmodes
filtered ($N$), on a logarithmic scale. The amplitude of the residual
foregrounds is lower than the amplitude of the median retained 21-cm signal
for $N\geq@@NA@@$ modes filtered.}


