to @@MAXDT@@\,K; with @@NA@@ foreground modes filtered, the depth at which
Fig.~\ref{fig:singular_values} is read, it leaves at most
@@SYSU@@\,mK
for the vertical
shift, @@SYSE@@\,mK east and @@SYSN@@\,mK north, against @@MED@@\,mK for the
